The native libraries on witos (plan step R1.2b, RFC 0015 section 8): WitOS has no GSSAPI and no OpenSSL, so
System.Net.Security.Native and System.Security.Cryptography.Native are not built; Negotiate authentication and
cryptography fail explicitly until a provider exists.

